tion: 'I positively affirmed, Rupert should never prevaile against the valiant Essex, &c., nor did he'; of the custody judgment, 'an errour in part I confess it was, yet... it was very neer truth, for in 1646 he was besieged in Oxford, and after surrender thereof... he was then at the mercy of the Parliament, and in their mercy: but they... let him depart... and so he escaped.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-45bb248d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果后考入垣中（都察院系统），历转山海巡抚、都御史。应验段独立载于原文。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-47adfef8", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后交子月壬辰日，病势渐解。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-48077877", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "于戊申日乃变脾病而不治。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4831437a", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "特朗普获胜且优势明确（312对226选举人票，并赢得普选票），并非「极小差距」惜败格局"}, {"anon_id": "P3-48380492", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果得眞定。又有以初爻爲內地﹐以五爻六爻爲邊缺。應初爻者﹐世與官星皆在初爻者是也。應五六爻者﹐或世在五爻﹐官在六爻﹔或世在六爻﹐官在五爻﹔戌土官星持世﹐同在五爻六爻是也。若在二三四爻以五行決之。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-48d9a484", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "韦千里终身以职业命师与著述为业，未入仕途显贵，晚年居香港，1988年卒。其一生轨迹与自断「笔耕终身、富贵无望」相合。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-49f6d667", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "林郑月娥（女性）于2017-03-26以777票当选第五任香港特首，为香港首位女性特首"}, {"anon_id": "P3-49f72f17", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於次日晴還又雨。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4a4bbc21", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "直至戊寅年甲子月癸卯日故。此年正值甲戌旬，父临岁旬空内，又绝于岁建，死于月建，胎于日建，元神又被寅年卯日相伤，故当终命也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4a4fe1d9", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后果然。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4a533ad1", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：李鸿章官至直隶总督兼北洋大臣、文华殿大学士，位极人臣，为晚清第一重臣；1901年卒于北京——与崇祯同格不同命的对勘成立"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4aa8c209", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果于本日巳时还一半，乙酉日巳时还清一半者．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4b97390e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "值子年農生被蝗虫食盡﹐全家瘟疫﹐六畜亦瘟。應子年者﹐占時原有子日沖其午火﹐因午火而值月建可以相敵﹐令遇子年﹐增其沖克﹐所以破敗。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4ce9b562", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "新加坡于2020年4月7日至6月1日实施「阻断措施」（Circuit Breaker），客工宿舍暴发大规模感染，4-6月正是本地最严重阶段；全球疫情则在2020年下半年进一步恶化，与「5-6月恢复正常」相反"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4d6d7e86", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "「自始至终，凡遇耘耕收获，辄遇雨，未尝得快作几日也」——全季每逢耘耕、收获皆遇雨，几乎没有痛快作活的日子。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4d8bd38b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "至甲午日而回禄，以夏至后先壬而后甲也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4d9ef24b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "數月後不斷曰﹕腰疼欲死﹐欲遷其墳。予曰﹕墳不必遷﹐卦中世爻被克﹐幸而旺相﹐土來克水﹐命道安土神則吉﹐果於安墳而愈。予曰﹕目下𨿽不遷改﹐終有遷改。彼曰﹕何也﹖予曰﹕化六沖不久之象。果於子年死母﹐起此冢合葬於他處也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-4e76e0b9", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於乙酉日卯時而死矣"}, {"anon_id": "P3-50165e19", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "三客至、内有杨姓，果如言；王宅书房被盗，所盗为郎君之物，三日后贼复来尽盗父子衣物；冬月清兵入山东、攻城陷邑，一一如占；王米山迁居淮安新安镇，其母未度九十而终（89岁）。各应验点均独立载于原文。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-5019809e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timi